      "source": "Applies the given <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/function/Function.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util.function\"><code>Function</code></a> to the content of the <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/domain/Chunk.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Chunk</code></a>.",
