    {
      "source": "a new <a href=\"Slice.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Slice</code></a> with the content of the current one mapped by the given <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/convert/converter/Converter.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core.convert.converter\"><code>Converter</code></a>.",
      "translation": "一个新的<a href=\"Slice.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.domain 中的接口\"><code>Slice</code></a>，其内容通过给定的<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/convert/converter/Converter.html\" title=\"org.springframework.core.convert.converter 中的类或接口\"><code>Converter</code></a>映射自当前对象。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Object.html#toString()\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\">toString</a></code> in class <code><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Object.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\">Object</a></code>",
      "translation": "`Object` 类中的 <code><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Object.html#toString()\" title=\"java.lang 中的类或接口\">toString</a></code>",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "the <a href=\"Pageable.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Pageable</code></a> to request the next <a href=\"Slice.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Slice</code></a>.",
      "translation": "通过<a href=\"Pageable.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.domain 中的接口\"><code>Pageable</code></a>请求下一个<a href=\"Slice.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.domain 中的接口\"><code>Slice</code></a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "the <a href=\"Pageable.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Pageable</code></a> to request the previous <a href=\"Slice.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Slice</code></a>.",
      "translation": "使用<a href=\"Pageable.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.domain 中的接口\"><code>Pageable</code></a>请求上一个<a href=\"Slice.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.domain 中的接口\"><code>Slice</code></a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "the <a href=\"Pageable.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Pageable</code></a> that's been used to request the current <a href=\"Slice.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Slice</code></a>.",
      "translation": "用于请求当前<a href=\"Slice.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.domain 中的接口\"><code>Slice</code></a>的<a href=\"Pageable.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.domain 中的接口\"><code>Pageable</code></a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<span id=\"type-param-T\"><code>T</code> - the type of which the page consists.</span>",
      "translation": "<span id=\"type-param-T\"><code>T</code> - 页面由该类型组成。</span>",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "if there is a next <a href=\"Slice.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Slice</code></a>.",
      "translation": "如果存在下一个<a href=\"Slice.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.domain 中的接口\"><code>Slice</code></a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "true if the current <a href=\"Slice.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Slice</code></a> is the last one.",
      "translation": "如果当前的<a href=\"Slice.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.domain 中的接口\"><code>Slice</code></a>是最后一个，则返回 true。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "the number of the current <a href=\"Slice.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Slice</code></a>.",
      "translation": "当前<a href=\"Slice.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.domain 中的接口\"><code>Slice</code></a>的数量。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "the size of the <a href=\"Slice.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Slice</code></a>.",
      "translation": "<a href=\"Slice.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.domain 中的接口\"><code>Slice</code></a> 的大小。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "the number of elements currently on this <a href=\"Slice.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Slice</code></a>.",
      "translation": "当前此<a href=\"Slice.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.domain 中的接口\"><code>Slice</code></a>上的元素数量。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "if there is a previous <a href=\"Slice.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Slice</code></a>.",
      "translation": "如果存在之前的<a href=\"Slice.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.domain 中的接口\"><code>Slice</code></a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "true if the current <a href=\"Slice.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Slice</code></a> is the first one.",
      "translation": "如果当前的<a href=\"Slice.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.domain 中的接口\"><code>Slice</code></a>是第一个，则为 true。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "true if the <a href=\"Slice.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Slice</code></a> has content at all.",
      "translation": "如果<a href=\"Slice.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.domain 中的接口\"><code>Slice</code></a>包含任何内容，则返回 true。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "the page content as <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/List.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>List</code></a>.",
      "translation": "页面内容为<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/List.html\" title=\"java.util 中的类或接口\"><code>List</code></a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "the sorting parameters for the <a href=\"Slice.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Slice</code></a>.",
      "translation": "<a href=\"Slice.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.domain 中的接口\"><code>Slice</code></a> 的排序参数。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>content</code> - the content of this page, must not be null.",
      "translation": "<code>content</code> - 此页面的内容，不得为 null。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>pageable</code> - the paging information, must not be null.",
      "translation": "<code>pageable</code> - 分页信息，不能为 null。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>total</code> - the total amount of items available. The total might be adapted considering the length of the content\n         given, if it is going to be the content of the last page. This is in place to mitigate inconsistencies.",
      "translation": "<code>total</code> - 可用项目的总数。如果该内容是最后一页的内容，则会根据给定内容的长度对总数进行调整，以避免出现不一致的情况。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>content</code> - must not be null.",
      "translation": "<code>content</code> 不能为 null。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Oliver Gierke, Mark Paluch",
      "translation": "奥利弗·吉尔克，马克·帕卢赫",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
